crates/ddai-web: the game view (ddmap.js, ddtee.js, game.js) and ddai-map's scene reader
------------------------------------------------------------------------

crates/ddai-web/assets/{ddmap,ddtee,game}.js and crates/ddai-map/src/scene.rs
draw and read DDNet maps the way the DDNet 20.1 client does (game/map/
map_renderer.cpp, render_layer.cpp, render_map.cpp, engine/graphics.cpp,
game/client/components/players.cpp, animstate.cpp, freezebars.cpp, nameplates.cpp,
datasrc/content.py) and are altered ports of that code (zlib license, the
DDNet notice above applies; these are not the original software). The camera,
parallax, animation key frames, sprite grids and the scoreboard and HUD metrics
also follow src/bot/webView.ts, webDraw.ts and webMap.ts of the original
project (Wranked1/DDNet-AI, GPL-3.0; the files are altered).

The graphics the page draws with (game.png, hud.png, emoticons.png, extras.png,
particles.png, arrow.png, the entities tilesets, the skins in skins/, the
external map images in mapres/, DejaVuSans.ttf) are DDNet's, licensed
CC BY-SA 3.0 (the DDNet data directory carries its own license files). They
are NOT part of this repository: the web unit serves them at runtime, after
login, from a local DDNet 20.1 data directory (--ddnet-data), and the page
credits DDNet for them.

