crates/ddai-jsmath: V8 / fdlibm
------------------------------------------------------------------------

`crates/ddai-jsmath/src/fdlibm/*.rs` (except `mod.rs`) is ported from V8's
own copy of fdlibm (`src/base/ieee754.cc`, from the Node 24.21.0 / V8 13.6
tag) or, for `bits.rs`'s `scalbn` alone, from fdlibm's own `s_scalbn.c`
directly (V8 never vendors `scalbn`; it calls the platform's, see that
file's header) — altered for this project: rewritten from C++/C to Rust,
using safe bit operations instead of pointer aliasing, otherwise
line-for-line with the same operation order (see each file's header and
the crate's README for the exact citations). Every file ported from
